# Every text file keeps LF line endings, also in a Windows checkout: the speaker's shell runs the
# device scripts, and the build hashes and patches files byte by byte.
* text=auto eol=lf
# ...except what cmd.exe runs: it reads batch files with CRLF reliably (labels, long lines).
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.patch -text
*.png binary
*.ico binary
